  "description": "One of Haro's most versatile, affordable, and trusty steeds, the Flightline One features an all new 6000 series alloy frame with an internal head tube mounted to a Haro suspension fork with 80mm of travel to smooth out all the bumps. FL One has tried and true 26\" alloy double wall rims, Pivot alloy hubs, stainless steel spokes and 2.2\" wide tires with multi surface tread patterns ideally suited to on road riding as well as off. Its 21 speed drive train has everything you need to get there and nothing you don't.\nNew MY18 Haro FL 6000 Series alloy frame w/ internal head tube\nHL CH-389 suspension fork w/ 80mm travel\n1-1/8\" internal Threadless headset\nShimano FC-TY301, 42x34x24T alloy crankset\nShimano Tourney TY-300 rear derailleur\nShimano EF-41 3x7-spd shifters\nShimano Tourney 7-spd freewheel 14-34T\nWide 2.2\" MTB tires\nAlloy DW rims w/ Pivit alloy cassette 32h hubs",
